Where FAO reports \verb{Arable land} but not \verb{Permanent crops} (924 country-years,
mostly arable-only economies) this yields the permanent land the survey
implies; where it reports \verb{Permanent crops} but not \verb{Arable land} (a few
coconut atolls) \code{arable_ha} is filled from \verb{Cropland - Permanent crops}.

